WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.051 --> 00:00:13.972
was walking to Kids Central with Bobby.

2
00:00:13.992 --> 00:00:17.695
"Nice pajamas," he said.

3
00:00:18.395 --> 00:00:19.256
Bobby laughed.

4
00:00:19.776 --> 00:00:21.598
"I like your bathrobe!"

5
00:00:22.618 --> 00:00:26.041
It was pajama day at school, so everyone was wearing pajamas.

6
00:00:26.861 --> 00:00:28.002
"I wonder what Mr.

7
00:00:28.062 --> 00:00:30.764
Dunn's pajamas will look like," Bobby said.

8
00:00:32.972 --> 00:00:34.252
The boys entered the gym.

9
00:00:34.272 --> 00:00:37.693
"Mr. Dunn said—" Bobby halted.

10
00:00:37.713 --> 00:00:41.074
"Miss Shelly!

11
00:00:41.434 --> 00:00:42.275
You're back!"

12
00:00:42.295 --> 00:00:44.755
"Of course, I'm back.

13
00:00:45.596 --> 00:00:48.517
I couldn't miss Pajama Day," Miss Shelly said.

14
00:00:49.897 --> 00:00:51.097
Nina hugged their teacher.

15
00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.418
"We missed you!"

16
00:00:53.438 --> 00:00:55.359
"What are we doing today?"

17
00:00:55.819 --> 00:00:56.519
Ethan asked.

18
00:00:56.539 --> 00:01:00.180
"Making breakfast, of course," Miss Shelly said.

19
00:01:01.064 --> 00:01:03.866
"We can make egg sandwiches or waffles.

20
00:01:04.226 --> 00:01:04.906
Your choice."

21
00:01:06.307 --> 00:01:07.548
Jason had an idea.

22
00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:09.149
"Can we make both?"

23
00:01:09.589 --> 00:01:10.209
he asked.

24
00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:13.611
"That's a lot of food," Miss Shelly said.

25
00:01:13.631 --> 00:01:16.733
"I mean, can we combine them?"

26
00:01:17.053 --> 00:01:17.894
Jason asked.

27
00:01:17.914 --> 00:01:20.555
"How?" Nina asked.

28
00:01:20.575 --> 00:01:24.217
"I saw it on a cooking show," Jason said.

29
00:01:24.237 --> 00:01:27.179
"The chef made egg and cheese sandwiches.

30
00:01:27.279 --> 00:01:31.013
But instead of using a frying pan, she used a waffle maker."

31
00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:33.154
"Let's do it!"

32
00:01:33.615 --> 00:01:34.315
Ethan said.

33
00:01:34.335 --> 00:01:37.577
"Can you show us how to make them, Jason?"

34
00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:38.998
Miss Shelly asked.

35
00:01:39.018 --> 00:01:41.319
"Sure," Jason said.

36
00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.902
Everyone put on their aprons, and Jason took charge.

37
00:01:45.922 --> 00:01:50.605
"Nina, can you please spray oil on both sides of the waffle maker?

38
00:01:51.365 --> 00:01:53.146
Then turn it on medium-high heat."

39
00:01:53.166 --> 00:01:54.767
"Got it!"

40
00:01:55.167 --> 00:01:55.828
Nina said.

41
00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:58.501
"Ethan and Bobby, can you crack some eggs?"

42
00:01:58.782 --> 00:01:59.602
Jason asked.

43
00:01:59.622 --> 00:02:01.523
"We need four eggs."

44
00:02:04.145 --> 00:02:06.247
Bobby began cracking eggs into a bowl.

45
00:02:09.309 --> 00:02:10.690
Ethan beat them with a whisk.

46
00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:14.752
"Jason, what should I do?"

47
00:02:15.253 --> 00:02:15.953
Izzie asked.

48
00:02:15.973 --> 00:02:18.735
"You can measure the shredded cheese."

49
00:02:23.858 --> 00:02:25.760
Jason put the frying pan on the stove.

50
00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:28.621
He turned on the heat and melted butter.

51
00:02:30.882 --> 00:02:33.763
When the pan was hot, he poured the eggs into the pan.

52
00:02:35.944 --> 00:02:37.305
Then he picked up a spatula.

53
00:02:37.325 --> 00:02:39.606
"Now I gently scramble them."

54
00:02:40.006 --> 00:02:41.327
Jason looked at Miss Shelly.

55
00:02:41.347 --> 00:02:43.428
"I have a job for you, Miss Shelly.

56
00:02:43.948 --> 00:02:47.710
Can you please put a slice of bread in each square of the waffle maker?"

57
00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:52.252
"Sure." She carefully placed the bread.

58
00:02:54.784 --> 00:02:57.245
Jason sprinkled shredded cheese on each slice.

59
00:02:57.265 --> 00:03:02.028
"Nina, can you add slices of ham?"

60
00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:06.070
Nina laid one slice of ham on each slice of bread.

61
00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:09.472
"Now we add the eggs," Jason said.

62
00:03:09.492 --> 00:03:11.473
"I can do that!"

63
00:03:11.773 --> 00:03:12.473
Bobby said.

64
00:03:19.357 --> 00:03:21.498
last part is fun," Jason said.

65
00:03:21.518 --> 00:03:26.534
"We put another slice of bread on top and gently close the lid."

66
00:03:26.554 --> 00:03:32.759
"At home we only make waffles in our waffle maker," Nina said.

67
00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:36.802
"You can make these sandwiches in a frying pan," Jason said.

68
00:03:36.822 --> 00:03:40.024
"But it's much more fun to use a waffle maker."

69
00:03:42.466 --> 00:03:44.828
Four minutes later he opened the waffle maker.

70
00:03:44.848 --> 00:03:46.930
"Perfect!" he said.

71
00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:49.652
"The sandwiches are golden brown."

72
00:03:49.672 --> 00:03:54.056
"They look just like waffles," Nina said.

73
00:03:54.816 --> 00:03:56.237
"Great job, Jason!"

74
00:03:57.497 --> 00:03:59.378
Miss Shelly lifted the sandwiches out.

75
00:04:02.859 --> 00:04:04.680
She cut them, and everyone had a piece.

76
00:04:09.322 --> 00:04:10.022
Ethan said.

77
00:04:10.042 --> 00:04:11.423
"What should we call them?"

78
00:04:12.563 --> 00:04:13.323
"Egg Waffles?"

79
00:04:13.844 --> 00:04:14.464
Izzie said.

80
00:04:14.484 --> 00:04:17.045
"Nope," Bobby replied.

81
00:04:17.065 --> 00:04:19.686
"The Chef Jason Special!"

82
00:04:21.067 --> 00:04:23.147
"Yes!" everyone said.

83
00:04:24.871 --> 00:04:26.884
Chef Jason grinned and took a bow.
